>Primary endpoint: 6.0% (5 mg), 5.6% (10 mg) and 2.6% (20 mg) vs 4.2%</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Major bleeding: 0.8%, 0.0%, 0.8% vs 0.0%</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-vhrm-4-1373"><label>a</label><p>30 mg bid or 40 mg od based on US or European requirements.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-vhrm-4-1373"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> THR, total hip replacement; TKR, total knee replacement; bid, twice daily; od, once daily; DVT, deep vein thrombosis; PE, pulmonary embolism.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>